    "Actual small/maximized/fullscreen open/closed states pass. The1920x1080capture shows the54px bar and centred cover; this is scoped geometry evidence, not a complete screen score. The existing source/title-bar context and navigation assets remain separate review work.",
    "A cold app restores the compact layout with identical catalogue values. A separate ordinary run retains the saved alternative metadata/shuffle/repeat layout. Light/System and blue accent update the actual player without moving paused progress0.25; another cold process restores the saved System/blue choice. No Windows-theme-change propagation claim is made.",
    "Nine original exports are checked against nonempty local files/root dimensions and callsites. Seven SVG XML trees match, including the new original19.5002x7.50015skip-arrow export reused in two24px wrappers; the two structurally different volume assets render identically at240x240 with QtSvg. Existing assets remain unchanged. Pointer/Return component activation and original artwork geometry pass separately.",
    "All six ordinary runs exit0/602modules/zero checked errors/all source/runtime/fixture/producer/cache guards. Native12cases, component4groups and existing customizer25checks pass. An initial copied-catalogue setup assertion stopped before app launch; intermediate reset failures and the component font-directory diagnostic are preserved separately."
